#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Street Legends frontend: Parks on REAL OpenStreetMap locations.

Mirrors the Activity Centers v2 pattern (real OSM locations, no seeded
fallback) and the Pharmacy / Fiend frontend patterns (paren-depth batch
discovery, brace-scan color/icon edits, literal emoji only).

What it adds:
  1. services/api.ts: getParksNearby + parkEnterPresence +
     parkLeavePresence + parkHeartbeatPresence + getParkPresence
     (count-guarded per function).
  2. hooks/useMapQueries.ts: getParksNearby appended LAST in the entity
     batch (index discovered live with the fiend-followup paren-depth
     parser, so existing results indices never move), parks field on
     MapEntitiesData. Wrapped in withTimeout(...) when the
     entities-fast helper is present, bare otherwise. On the live-like
     shape (18 calls, pharmacies at results[17]) parks land at
     results[18].
  3. app/(tabs)/index.tsx: 'park' marker type, nearbyParks memo,
     mapMarkers spread + deps, handleMarkerPress branch + deps, popup
     with ENTER only (plus the popup's built-in close X), ENTER opens a
     full-screen Modal on the park picture (embedded below as a data
     URI; the GitHub push tool cannot carry binary files) showing
     "Inside now:" — YOUR name first, then your FRIENDS who are inside
     (strangers fetched but NOT listed) — plus your money total
     (player.cash). Presence lifecycle mirrors the house / activity
     center pattern: enter on open, poll 15s, heartbeat 30s, leave on
     exit. No menu, no games, no shop inside. Entry open to everyone.
  4. components/GameMap.tsx: 'park' in the marker type union,
     markerColors park '#E91E63' (pink — distinct from activity-center
     purple #7b1fa2, fiend green #8BC34A, pharmacy teal #009688),
     markerIcons park literal basketball-player character (NEVER a
     unicode escape), a park marker branch mirroring the
     activityCenter pattern, park in the 48x62 location sizing
     (isLocationMarker). Color/icon edits use a brace-count scan,
     NEVER a negated-brace-star regex on these objects (that exact
     pattern broke the map once: the escapes contain a closing brace
     that ends the match early).

Does NOT touch the Fiend, pharmacy, once-only, or activity-center
code.

Run:  python3 frontend/patch-park-frontend.py
   or:  python3 frontend/patch-park-frontend.py /path/to/app
Idempotent: rerun prints ALREADY_APPLIED per part, files unchanged.
Frontend / Expo Go only. No build, no Deploy for this patch itself
(the backend patch needs Publish separately).
"""
